{"sha": "2c312e8c8b993fc1b656bef067ad27bfcfbf213e416b582042f90f24d21fc57a", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g4:mult} 章 --- 较大数的乘法}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:mult:1}", "$470$; \\quad $2\\,300$; \\quad $720$; \\quad $4\\,500$; \\quad", "$2\\,100$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:mult:2}", "$34 \\times 21 = 34 \\times 20 + 34 = 680 + 34 = 714$；竖式", "中的各行与之相同，分别为 $34$ 和 $680$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:mult:3}", "$63 \\times 24 = 1\\,512$; \\quad", "$85 \\times 47 = 3\\,995$; \\quad", "$126 \\times 53 = 6\\,678$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:mult:4}", "$208 \\times 34$：估算 $200 \\times 34 = 6\\,800$；精确值", "为 $7\\,072$。", "", "$517 \\times 62$：估算 $500 \\times 60 = 30\\,000$；精确值", "为 $32\\,054$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:mult:5}", "$45 \\times 11 = 450 + 45 = 495$.", "", "$32 \\times 99 = 3\\,200 - 32 = 3\\,168$.", "", "$24 \\times 45 = 12 \\times 90 = 1\\,080$（或再算一次：", "$6 \\times 180 = 1\\,080$).", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:mult:6}", "$26 \\times 18 = 468$ 个座位。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:mult:7}", "估算：$30 \\times 50 = 1\\,500$。精确计算：", "$32 \\times 48 = 1\\,536$ 箱。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:mult:8}", "她忘了 $2$ 在 $23$ 中表示\\emph{十位}，", "第二行应为 $57 \\times 20 = 1\\,140$，而不是 $114$。正确的和：", "$171 + 1\\,140 = 1\\,311$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:mult:9}", "郁金香：$14 \\times 35 = 490$。水仙：$12 \\times 28 = 336$。", "总和：$490 + 336 = 826$ 朵花。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:mult:10}", "估算：$70 \\times 30 = 2\\,100$ 千克。精确计算：", "$67 \\times 30 = 2\\,010$ 千克。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:mult:11}", "一个由单位正方形组成的 $15 \\times 12$ 长方形，可以用一条竖直的", "直线切成一个 $15 \\times 10$ 的部分和一个 $15 \\times 2$ 的部分：分别数出", "各部分的个数，得 $150 + 30 = 180$。另一种切法同样可行，", "例如 $15 = 10 + 5$：$10 \\times 12 + 5 \\times 12 = 120 + 60", "= 180$。无论怎样切分长方形，正方形的总个数", "都保持不变。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}